## Requirements

- Python 3.12 (see `.python-version`)
- [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/) for dependency management

## Development setup

```bash
# Install dependencies (creates .venv and uv.lock)
uv sync

# Install git hooks
uv run pre-commit install
```

## Common tasks

```bash
# Run tests
uv run pytest

# Lint
uv run ruff check .

# Format
uv run ruff format .

# Type check
uv run mypy src

# Run all pre-commit hooks against the whole repo
uv run pre-commit run --all-files
```

